      "name": "Pietro's Farm",
      "description": "Pietro's small farm: a fenced compound with a field of dark tilled soil on the west side, a packed-earth yard and storage Chest on the east, and a gate in the south fence leading out to the track. A small pond sits just north of the fence.",
